/E (Dr B. R. Ambedkar National Institute of Technology \(NIT Jalandhar\), established in 1987 as a Regional Engineering College, has evolved into a premier technical institution in India. It became a National Institute of Technology \(NIT\) in 2002, expanding its academic programs and enhancing research capabilities. NIT Jalandhar is accredited by the National Board of Accreditation \(NBA\) and is recognized for its strong placement record, with numerous leading companies recruiting graduates each year. The institute fosters a culture of innovation and entrepreneurship while promoting holistic development through extracurricular activities and industry exposure.)
